    'v7.faq.q8': 'How is it different from other YouTube analytics sites?', 'v7.faq.a8': 'Other sites focus on polishing videos you already posted. CNOL RADAR watches references that fit your channel every hour and brings you the next idea first.',
    'v8.end.sub': 'Leave the reference checking to the agent and get your first idea today. Free to start, no card needed.',
    'v6.h1a': 'Grow your views and', 'v6.h1b': 'subscribers on YouTube',
    'v6.meta.title': 'CNOL RADAR · AI agent for YouTube idea analysis', 'v6.meta.desc': 'An AI idea-analysis agent collects references, analyzes breakouts and suggests your next idea — for Shorts and long-form.',
