    'v8.fb2.t': 'Know if a topic is worth it — as a score', 'v8.fb2.d': 'It analyzes the top 50 YouTube results for demand, competition and small-channel wins, then scores the opportunity. Small channels that broke out come first, so they’re easy to learn from.',
    'v8.fb2.l1': 'Topic search →', 'v8.fb2.l2': 'Ideas from comments →', 'v8.fb2.l3': 'Today’s ideas →', 'v8.fb2.cta': 'See topic scores',
    'v8.fb3.t': 'Know how many times your usual — before you post', 'v8.fb3.d': 'Enter a title and it forecasts how many times your usual it could get, from similar references’ real results and your channel data. Pit titles against each other and post the winner.',
    'v8.fb3.l1': 'Idea forecast →', 'v8.fb3.l2': 'Title duel →', 'v8.fb3.cta': 'Forecast my title',
    'v8.fb4.t': 'A breakout title, same structure, your topic', 'v8.fb4.d': 'It keeps a breakout reference title’s structure and swaps in your topic, plus the tags and hashtags similar videos actually used.',
    'v8.fb4.l1': 'Title & tag helper →', 'v8.fb4.l2': '3 ideas this week →', 'v8.fb4.l3': 'Try this? →', 'v8.fb4.cta': 'Make my version',
